{'symbol': 'KMB', 'date': '2021-09-13 16:15:00', 'title': 'KIMBERLY-CLARK NAMES DOUG CUNNINGHAM TO LEAD ITS EMEA CONSUMER BUSINESS', 'text': 'DALLAS, SEPT. 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KIMBERLY-CLARK CORPORATION (NYSE:KMB) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT DOUG CUNNINGHAM, CURRENTLY MANAGING DIRECTOR OF KIMBERLY-CLARK AUSTRALIA AND NEW ZEALAND, HAS BEEN NAMED PRESIDENT OF ITS EMEA CONSUMER BUSINESS, AND REPORT TO CHAIRMAN AND CEO MIKE HSU.'}